('Squat (On Knees) (Barbell)', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'echClj7', array['Begin by kneeling on the ground with your knees about hip width and your toes pointing forward.', 'Set a barbell across your shoulders, gripping it with palms facing down and your hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Contralateral Forward Lunge (Dumbbell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'ecl28tP', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand.', 'Step forward with your right foot, with your spine steady and core engaged.', 'Set your stance wide enough to balance before bending either knee.', 'Step into the movement and bend both knees, keeping your front foot planted.', 'Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.', 'Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.']::text[]),
('Shrug (Cable)', 'traps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'Eg98Ft9', array['Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Hold the cable handles with palms facing down and let your arms hang down in front of you.', 'Let the arms hang long and keep the head neutral.', 'Lift your shoulders toward your ears without bending the elbows or rolling the shoulders.', 'Lift and lower vertically without circling the shoulders.', 'Bring the weight or body back to its starting position without rushing.']::text[]),
('Deadlift (Cable)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads', 'back']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'eGDudUV', array['Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Before moving, bend at the hips and knees, lowering your torso until your back is parallel to the ground.', 'Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.', 'Push the hips back while keeping the load close and the spine steady.', 'Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.', 'Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.']::text[]),
