('Landmine Lateral Raise', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'eXMFHww', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and knees soft.', 'Take hold of the barbell with palms facing down, resting it on the front of your shoulders.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Raise the arms out to the sides to about shoulder height without leaning or shrugging.', 'Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.']::text[]),
('Reverse Wrist Curl (Cable)', 'forearms', '{}'::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'eYmsEPR', array['Connect a cable to a low pulley and Take a seat on the bench facing the cable machine.', 'Hold the cable handle with palms facing down.', 'Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.', 'Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.', 'Use a small, smooth range without swinging the elbows.', 'Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands.']::text[]),
('Bar Lateral Pulldown (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'eYnzaCm', array['Set the cable pulley to a high position and attach a straight bar.', 'Sit facing the cable machine with your feet planted and your knees soft.', 'Sit tall and set the shoulders before drawing the handle down.', 'Pull the handle down by driving your elbows toward your ribs; keep your torso steady.', 'Pull with the elbows rather than leaning far back to move the handle.', 'Let the handle rise steadily until the arms are long, then reset the shoulders.']::text[]),
('Kneeling Rear Delt Row (With Rope) (Cable)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back', 'biceps']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'eZ79rbI', array['Connect a rope handle to a low cable pulley and kneel down facing the machine.', 'Hold the rope with a neutral grip (palms facing each other) and extend your arms fully in front of you.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Decline Sit-Up (Weighted)', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'EZeDVzO', array['Settle onto a decline bench with your feet secured under the foot pads.', 'Set your hands behind your head or across your chest.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Reverse Wrist Curl (Band)', 'forearms', '{}'::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'Ezpnw9d', array['Take a seat on a bench or chair with your feet planted.', 'Take hold of the band with palms facing down, and wrap it around your fingers.', 'Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.', 'Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands.']::text[]),
('Ring Dips', 'triceps', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'ezTvXcr', array['Begin by hanging from the rings with your arms straight and your body straight.', 'Before moving, lower your body by bending your elbows until your shoulders are below your elbows.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('Seated Shoulder Press (Parallel Grip) (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'f1jf47L', array['Take a seat on a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing inward.', 'Before moving, raise the dumbbells to shoulder height, elbows bent and palms facing forward.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Preacher Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'F1KxjBa', array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing your torso.', 'Hold your elbows near your torso and rotate the palms of your hands until they are facing forward.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl the weight while your upper arms stay in contact with the pad.', 'Keep the palms facing each other and the wrists straight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Kneeling Lat Stretch', 'back', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'f38OEuO', array['Get down on the ground with your knees about hip width and your toes pointing back.', 'Reach your arms overhead and interlace your fingers.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Incline Biceps Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'F3xgbjF', array['Take a seat on an incline bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward, and arms straight.', 'With your upper arms stationary, exhale and curl the weights while contracting your biceps.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Standing Pull-Up (Assisted)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'f4xtKBj', array['Set the machine to your desired weight and height settings.', 'Face the machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.', 'Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Straight Bar Dip (Weighted)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'F56Xpw3', array['Set yourself between parallel bars with your arms straight and your body straight.', 'Before moving, lower your body by bending your elbows until your upper arms are parallel to the ground.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('Squat Row (With Rope Attachment) (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'f7fnAIB', array['Connect a rope to a cable machine at waist height.', 'Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Incline Push-Up (On Box)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'F7vjXqT', array['Set your hands on the edge of a box or elevated surface, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Reach your legs behind you, resting on the balls of your feet, creating a straight line from your head to your heels.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Thruster (Barbell)', 'shoulders', array['quads', 'glutes', 'hamstrings', 'core']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'f7Y9eDZ', array['Begin by standing with your feet about shoulder width, holding a barbell at shoulder height with palms facing down.', 'Before moving, lower into a squat position by bending your knees and pushing your hips back.', 'Rack the weight securely and brace before dropping into the squat.', 'Stand from the squat and use that leg drive to press the weight overhead.', 'Let the leg drive start the press while keeping the ribs from flaring.', 'Return along the same path at a controlled pace.']::text[]),
('Astride Jumps', 'cardio', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'f9lVSSI', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width.', 'Before moving, bend your knees and lower your body into a squat position.', 'Bend the hips and knees slightly to load the jump.', 'Load the legs with a small bend, then drive through the floor and land softly.', 'Land with bent hips and knees and let the feet absorb the impact.', 'Absorb the landing through the hips and knees before repeating.']::text[]),
('Standing Wide-Grip Biceps Curl (Barbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'faHKVkK', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold a barbell with palms facing up, hands wider than about shoulder width.', 'Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position and your elbows close to your torso.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Dip', 'triceps', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'FAoIFMw', array['Face the away from a bench or chair, from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Set one hand on the bench or chair behind you, fingers pointing toward your body.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Prone Hamstring (Assisted)', 'hamstrings', array['glutes', 'back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'fBnPpzd', array['Position yourself face down on a mat or bench with your legs straight.', 'Ask a partner to help or use a resistance band to secure your ankles.', 'Line the knees up with the machine or bench edge before starting the curl.', 'Bend your knees to draw the pad toward you without lifting your hips from the support.', 'Keep the hips still while the knees bend.', 'Ease back to the start before repeating.']::text[]),
('Chair Leg Extended Stretch', 'quads', array['hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'fF6GKVh', array['Take a seat on the edge of a chair with your back straight and feet planted.', 'Reach one leg straight out in front of you, keeping your heel on the ground.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Standing Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'ffQsyBj', array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in one hand, palm facing forward and arm straight.', 'With your upper arm stationary, exhale and curl the weight upward while contracting your biceps.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Frog Crunch', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'FFRP97T', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Set your hands behind your head with your elbows pointing outwards.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Bring the soles of your feet together, let the knees open, then curl your ribs toward your pelvis.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Standing Single-Leg Calf Raise (Cable)', 'calves', '{}'::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'fgc9Xdl', array['Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Use the cable machine for support.', 'Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.', 'Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.', 'Keep the pelvis level as the supporting leg does the work.', 'Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Bent Over Row (Machine)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'Fhdtwf3', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, knees soft, and hold a barbell with palms facing down.', 'Bend forward at the hips, with your spine steady and your head up.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Twist (Up-Down) (Cable)', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'fhZQPlV', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, facing the cable machine.', 'Take hold of the cable handle with both hands ahead of your chest, keeping your arms soft.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('Lying Dumbbell Leg Curl', 'hamstrings', array['glutes']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'FkBIE6a', array['Lie face down on a flat bench with your knees just past its edge.', 'Hold a light dumbbell securely between your feet and keep your hips on the bench.', 'Brace your trunk and keep the thighs resting on the bench.', 'Bend your knees to draw your heels toward your glutes without lifting the hips.', 'Lower the weight slowly until the legs are nearly straight, then reset your grip before repeating.']::text[]),
('Back and Forth Step', 'cardio', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'glutes', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'fNGumX0', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width.', 'Move forward with your right foot, bending your knee and lowering your body into a lunge position.', 'Start at a pace that lets the feet and arms move in sync.', 'Move at a repeatable pace, keeping the motion smooth and your breathing steady.', 'Keep the pattern repeatable as speed increases.', 'Keep the rhythm for the planned interval, slowing if your form starts to slip.']::text[]),
('Anti Gravity Press (EZ Bar)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'chest']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'fprd84i', array['Begin by standing with your feet about shoulder width and holding the ez barbell with palms facing down.', 'Raise the barbell to shoulder height, keeping your elbows soft and your palms facing forward.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Dumbbells Seated Triceps Extension', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'FQXdXzY', array['Take a seat on a bench with your back straight and feet planted.', 'Take a dumbbell in both hands with palms facing down, and raise it above your head.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep the upper arms steady while the forearms travel.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Push Press (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'core']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'FS63wTN', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand at shoulder level.', 'Before moving, bend your knees slightly and dip your body down, then explosively extend your legs and press the dumbbells overhead.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Pullover on Exercise Ball (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'FSD6PGL', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball and hold a dumbbell with both hands above your chest, arms extended.', 'With control lower the dumbbell behind your head while keeping your arms straight.', 'Set the ribs down and keep a small elbow bend before lowering the weight.', 'Lower the weight in an arc behind your head until you feel a comfortable shoulder stretch.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Pull the weight back over the chest along the same arc, without lifting the ribs.']::text[]),
('Wide-Grip Chest Dip on High Parallel Bars', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'FSF9WOs', array['Set yourself on the parallel bars with your arms straight and your body suspended in the air.', 'Tip forward slightly and lower your body by bending your elbows until your chest is just above the bars.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('Triceps Press', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'fSrPP6B', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your knees soft.', 'Reach your arms straight out in front of you, parallel to the ground.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Side-Lying One Hand Raise (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'fTlkJop', array['Settle onto your side with your legs extended and your head supported by your arm.', 'Take a dumbbell in your top hand with your palm facing down.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Lift the weights away from your torso to about shoulder height, keeping the elbows softly bent.', 'Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.']::text[]),
('T-Bar Reverse-Grip Row (Machine)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'FVM1AUZ', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handles with palms facing down, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Low Fly (Cable)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'FVmZVhk', array['Connect the handles to the low pulleys of a cable machine and select an appropriate weight.', 'Take your place in the middle of the machine with your feet about shoulder width and a slight bend in your knees.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Standing Shoulder External Rotation (Cable)', 'shoulders', array['traps']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'FWdVhcW', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your knees soft.', 'Take hold of the cable handle with your arm extended in front of you, parallel to the ground.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('One Hand Pull-Up (Weighted)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'fXfqg1E', array['Take hold of the pull-up bar with palms facing down, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Suspend yourself from the bar with your arm straight and your body straight.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.', 'Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Seated Single-Leg Calf Raise - Hammer Grip (Dumbbell)', 'calves', array['hamstrings', 'glutes']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'FxhcxUW', array['Take a seat on a bench or chair with your feet planted and a dumbbell resting on your thighs.', 'Set one foot on a raised surface, such as a step or block, with your heel hanging off the edge.', 'Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.', 'Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.', 'Keep the pelvis level as the supporting leg does the work.', 'Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Exercise Ball on the Wall Calf Raise (Tennis Ball Between Ankles)', 'calves', array['hamstrings', 'quads']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'FY3UdNT', array['Face the wall from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Set an exercise ball between the wall and your lower back.', 'Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.', 'Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.']::text[]),
('Hammer Curl on Exercise Ball (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'fY68AyX', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with your feet planted and your back straight.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing your body and your arms straight.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Curl with palms facing each other and elbows near your sides; avoid rocking back.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Alternate Hammer Preacher Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'fy7Tgy4', array['Take a seat on a preacher bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing your torso and arms straight.', 'Let the elbows do the moving while the upper arms stay put and Breathe out and curl the weights while contracting your biceps.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl the weight while your upper arms stay in contact with the pad.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Russian Twist (Weighted)', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'fZFZ704', array['Take a seat on the ground with your knees bent and your feet planted.', 'Take a weight or medicine ball with both hands ahead of your chest.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('Curl-Up', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'g2oKspu', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Set your hands behind your head with your elbows pointing outwards.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Lying Calf Press (Machine)', 'calves', array['hamstrings', 'glutes']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'g376LuL', array['Set the sled machine to a comfortable weight.', 'Take a seat on the sled machine with your back against the pad and your feet on the platform.', 'Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.', 'Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.', 'Pause at the top without rolling the ankles outward.', 'Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.']::text[]),
('Chin-Ups (Narrow Parallel Grip)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'G70mEAJ', array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with a narrow parallel grip, palms facing toward you.', 'Engage your back muscles and pull your body up toward the bar, keeping your elbows close to your body.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.', 'Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Vertical Pallof Press (Band)', 'core', array['glutes']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'G7PXMlT', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and wrap the band around a sturdy object at chest height.', 'Take hold of the band with both hands and step away from the anchor point, creating tension in the band.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Reverse-Grip Bent Over Row (EZ Bar)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'G8dXpNG', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and knees soft.', 'Take hold of the ez barbell with palms facing up, and hands about shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Row (Kettlebell)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'kettlebell', 'weight_reps', 'g9AsZ8P', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a kettlebell in one hand with palms facing down.', 'Bend your knees slightly and hinge forward at the hips, with your spine steady and your core engaged.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Back Lever', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'GaSzzuh', array['Begin by hanging from a pull-up bar with palms facing down, hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Brace your trunk and pull your shoulder blades down and back.', 'Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.', 'Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.', 'Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.', 'Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.']::text[]),
('Alternate Triceps Extension (Cable)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'Gchi5Tr', array['Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Take hold of the cable handle with your right hand and bring your arm up so that your upper arm is parallel to the ground and your elbow is bent at a 90-degree angle.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Incline Scapula Push Up', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'GdMa1ET', array['Angle the bench to roughly 45 degrees.', 'Set your hands on the bench just beyond shoulder width.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Hanging Pike', 'core', array['shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'gdPIyyO', array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your arms straight and your palms turned away from you.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your legs up toward the bar, keeping them straight.', 'Brace the abdomen and keep the shoulders anchored to the support.', 'Lift your legs by bracing your trunk and moving at the hips rather than swinging.', 'Slow the legs before they pull the lower back out of position.', 'Lower the legs slowly without swinging or losing your trunk position.']::text[]),
('Single Leg Deadlift (Barbell)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'back']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'gEyURal', array['Stand and set your feet about hip width, holding a barbell ahead of your thighs with palms facing down.', 'Transfer your weight onto your left foot and lift your right foot slightly off the ground.', 'Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.', 'Push the hips back while keeping the load close and the spine steady.', 'Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.', 'Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.']::text[]),
('Closer Hack Squat (Machine)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'gf3ZjB9', array['Set the sled machine to a comfortable weight and position yourself with your back against the pad.', 'Set your feet about shoulder width on the platform, toes slightly pointed outwards.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Overhead Squat (Barbell)', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'calves', 'core']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'gfk9kD4', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and toes slightly turned out.', 'Take hold of the barbell with a wide grip, positioning it overhead with your arms straight.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Single Leg Split Squat (Barbell)', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'gGNQmVt', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a barbell across your upper back.', 'Step far forward with one leg, keeping your torso upright.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Seated Alternate Front Raise (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'biceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'gH5fRsC', array['Take a seat on a bench with your back straight and feet planted.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing your body and arms extended down by your sides.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Lift the arms forward to about shoulder height, keeping the ribs down and torso still.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Standing Alternating Triceps Kickback (Dumbbell)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'Gi2BXfK', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand.', 'Bend your knees slightly and hinge forward at the hips, with your spine steady.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Hold the upper arm beside your torso and straighten the elbow behind you.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Glute Bridge March', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'GibBPPg', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Tighten your glutes and lift your hips off the ground, forming a straight line from your knees to your shoulders.', 'Plant the feet and keep the ribs from flaring as the hips prepare to rise.', 'Press through the feet and lift your hips until your torso and thighs line up.', 'Stop when the hips line up with the torso; do not arch higher through the lower back.', 'Lower the hips steadily and keep the feet planted for the next lift.']::text[]),
('Close-Grip Chin-Up on Dip Cage (Weighted)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Gk1r408', array['Take your place in front of the dip cage and grab the parallel bars with palms facing up, hands about shoulder width.', 'Suspend yourself from the bars with your arms straight, feet off the ground, and body straight.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.', 'Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Incline Press (Cable)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'GKEH6jj', array['Set the cable machine to a low pulley position.', 'Take a seat on an incline bench turned away from the cable machine.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Single Leg Deadlift (Dumbbell)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'gKozT8X', array['Stand and set your feet about hip width, holding a dumbbell in your right hand.', 'Transfer your weight onto your left leg and lift your right foot slightly off the ground.', 'Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.', 'Push the hips back while keeping the load close and the spine steady.', 'Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.', 'Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.']::text[]),
('Exercise Ball Supine Triceps Extension', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'Gm2Uv1z', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with your feet planted and your knees bent at a 90-degree angle.', 'Take a dumbbell with both hands and extend your arms straight up toward the ceiling.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Scapula Push-Up', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'gMyx3Qn', array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands directly under your shoulders and your body in a straight line.', 'Lower your chest toward the ground, keeping your elbows close to your body.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Stability Ball Crunch (Full Range Hands Behind Head)', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Gn5FwYT', array['Take a seat on the stability ball with your feet planted and your knees bent at a 90-degree angle.', 'Set your hands behind your head with your elbows pointing outwards.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('High Bar Squat (Barbell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves', 'core']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'Gnfo4FM', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, toes slightly turned out.', 'Set the barbell on your upper back, resting it on your traps.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Hammer Curls (With Arm Blaster) (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'GNhAeJ0', array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing your torso.', 'Hold your elbows near your torso and rotate the palms of your hands until they are facing forward.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Curl with palms facing each other and elbows near your sides; avoid rocking back.', 'Keep the palms facing each other and the wrists straight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Exercise Ball Single-Legged Diagonal Kick Hamstring Curl', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'GOJKFfO', array['Begin by lying on your back with your legs extended and your heels resting on top of the stability ball.', 'Set your arms by your sides for stability.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the pelvis level as the supporting leg does the work.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Behind Neck Press (Smith Machine)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'back']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'Gpn4ADc', array['Set the seat height of the smith machine so that the bar is at shoulder level.', 'Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your knees soft.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Decline Bench Press (Barbell)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'GrO65fd', array['Secure the feet on a decline bench, keeping the head below the hips.', 'Hold the barbell with palms facing down just beyond shoulder width.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Bodyweight Side-Lying Biceps Curl', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'gscGLOU', array['Settle onto your side with your legs extended and your head supported by your arm.', 'Hold your upper arm against your side and bend your elbow to curl your forearm toward your shoulder.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Upper Back Stretch', 'back', array['shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'GSDioYu', array['Stand tall with your feet about shoulder width.', 'Reach your arms straight in front of you, parallel to the ground.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Lying Single-Arm Deltoid Rear (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'gSw59a4', array['Position yourself face down on a flat bench with a dumbbell in one hand, palm facing inwards.', 'Extend your arm straight down toward the floor, keeping it close to your body.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Lift the weights away from your torso to about shoulder height, keeping the elbows softly bent.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Three Bench Dips (Weighted)', 'triceps', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'gtO1ErP', array['Take a seat on the edge of a bench with your hands gripping the edge, fingers pointing forward.', 'Step your feet forward, sliding your butt off the bench and supporting your weight with your arms.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('Machine Reverse Decline Close-Grip Bench Press (Smith Machine)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'Gu2ENkm', array['Set the smith machine to a decline position.', 'Get onto the bench with your feet secured under the foot pads.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Chair Squat (Smith Machine)', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'Gu2rNJd', array['Set the height of the smith machine bar to a comfortable position.', 'Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, toes slightly turned out.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Curtsey Squat', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'gUjqdei', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width.', 'Step diagonally behind and across your body with your right foot, crossing it behind your left leg.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Deadlift (Machine)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'GUT8I22', array['Set the seat height and foot platform to your desired position.', 'Take a seat on the machine with your back against the pad and your feet flat on the foot platform.', 'Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.', 'Push the hips back while keeping the load close and the spine steady.', 'Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.', 'Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.']::text[]),
('Biceps Pull-Up', 'biceps', array['forearms', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'guT8YnS', array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your palms turned away from you and your hands about shoulder width.', 'Brace your trunk and pull yourself up by bending your elbows, bringing your chest toward the bar.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.', 'Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Reverse Single-Arm Curl (Cable)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'gVlnLIJ', array['Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Hold the cable handle with palms facing up, palm facing down.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Curl the weight with your palms facing down, keeping the elbows close and torso still.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Concentration Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'gvsWLQw', array['Take a seat on a bench with your legs spread apart and a dumbbell in one hand, resting your elbow on the inside of your thigh.', 'Fully extend your arm and hold the dumbbell with palms facing up.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Incline Single-Arm Fly (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'Gw2HFvW', array['Set the incline bench to a 30-45 degree angle.', 'Take a seat on the bench with a dumbbell in one hand, resting it on your thigh.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Full Planche Push-Up', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'gw9PqGk', array['Place your palms near the hips and lean forward until the shoulders pass the wrists.', 'Lift both feet clear of the floor with straight legs and a firm trunk.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Cossack Squats (Weighted)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'GWoKnIm', array['Stand and set your feet wider than about shoulder width and toes pointing slightly outward.', 'Take a weight ahead of your chest with both hands.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Shift into one hip and bend that knee while the other leg stays long; keep both feet in contact with the floor.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
