('Lying Calves Stretch (Assisted)', 'calves', array['hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'GxDwDX0', array['Settle onto your back with your legs extended.', 'Before moving, bend one knee and place your foot flat on the ground.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Rollout From Bench (Barbell)', 'core', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'Gxg9lDc', array['Begin by kneeling on the floor with a barbell placed on a bench in front of you.', 'Hold the barbell with palms facing down, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Tighten the abdomen and keep the pelvis tucked before the arms reach away.', 'Reach the arms away while keeping your ribs and pelvis aligned; stop before the lower back sags.', 'Stop reaching when the lower back starts to sag.', 'Pull back to the start through your shoulders and abdominals, keeping the same body line.']::text[]),
('Guillotine Bench Press (Barbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'GXoaSgn', array['Settle onto a bench with your feet planted and your back pressed against the bench.', 'Hold the barbell with palms facing down, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Kneeling Plank Tap Shoulder', 'core', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'h1ezqSu', array['Begin in a kneeling position with your hands on the ground, about shoulder width.', 'Reach your legs behind you, resting on your toes, and lift your body into a plank position.', 'Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.', 'Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.', 'Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.', 'Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.']::text[]),
('Biceps Curl V Sit on Bosu Ball (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms', 'shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'H1XAdpk', array['Take a seat on a bosu ball with your feet planted and your knees bent at a 90-degree angle.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing forward and your arms straight down by your sides.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('V-Up (Band)', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'H6ETwO9', array['Settle onto your back with your legs straight and your arms extended overhead, holding the band.', 'Engaging your abs, lift your legs and upper body off the ground simultaneously, reaching your hands toward your toes.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Raise your straight legs and torso together, reaching toward the feet before lowering under control.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Single Leg Squat (Dumbbell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'H6ybluc', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand.', 'Reach one leg forward and keep it off the ground throughout the exercise.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Two-Arm Curl on Incline Bench (Cable)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'H9y3Dkr', array['Take a seat on an incline bench with your back against the pad and your feet planted.', 'Hold the cable handles with palms facing up, and your arms straight.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Turkish Get-Up (Squat Style) (Kettlebell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'core']::text[], 'kettlebell', 'weight_reps', 'Ha7SZ3y', array['Begin by lying on your back with your legs extended and the kettlebell held in your right hand, arm straight above your shoulder.', 'Before moving, bend your right knee and place your right foot flat on the ground, keeping your left leg extended.', 'Fix your gaze on the load and stack the working wrist above its shoulder.', 'Move from lying to standing in stages, watching the weight and keeping the supporting arm stacked.', 'Move one stage at a time instead of rushing from floor to standing.', 'Reverse the same stages to return to the floor, keeping the load steady throughout.']::text[]),
('Hip Adduction (Cable)', 'quads', array['glutes']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'hBGWILP', array['Connect the ankle cuff to your ankle and stand facing the cable machine.', 'Set yourself far enough away from the machine so that there is tension on the cable.', 'Square the pelvis before moving the working leg.', 'Draw the working leg inward against resistance without leaning sideways.', 'Move only as far as the pelvis can remain steady.', 'Ease back to the start before repeating.']::text[]),
