('Rope Extension Incline Bench Row (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'MgKwAAo', array['Prepare an incline bench at a 45-degree angle and attach a cable machine to the low pulley.', 'Connect a rope handle to the cable machine and sit on the incline bench facing the machine.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Press on Exercise Ball (Cable)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'MKIelrR', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with your feet planted and your back straight.', 'Take a cable handle in one hand and position your arm at chest height, elbow bent.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
