('Bench Squat (Dumbbell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'mnzcrIB', array['Set a dumbbell on the ground in front of a bench.', 'Face the away from the bench from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Lying Triceps Extension (Dumbbell)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'mpKZGWz', array['Settle onto a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing each other.', 'Reach your arms straight up over your chest, keeping your elbows close to your body.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep the upper arms steady while the forearms travel.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Straight-Leg Outer Hip Abductor', 'glutes', array['hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'mQ1tBXn', array['Settle onto your side with your legs straight and stacked on top of each other.', 'Set your bottom arm under your head for support.', 'Square the pelvis before moving the working leg.', 'Move the working leg sideways from the hip without swinging your torso.', 'Move only as far as the pelvis can remain steady.', 'Return along the same path at a controlled pace.']::text[]),
('Jack Burpee', 'cardio', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves', 'shoulders', 'triceps', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'mr7pkqP', array['Begin in a standing position with your feet about shoulder width.', 'Before moving, lower your body into a squat position, placing your hands on the ground in front of you.', 'Start at a pace that lets the feet and arms move in sync.', 'Move at a repeatable pace, keeping the motion smooth and your breathing steady.', 'Keep the pattern repeatable as speed increases.', 'Keep the rhythm for the planned interval, slowing if your form starts to slip.']::text[]),
('Arnold Press (Kettlebell)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'back']::text[], 'kettlebell', 'weight_reps', 'Mr8d4KA', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a kettlebell in each hand at shoulder height with your palms facing toward you.', 'Brace your trunk and press the kettlebells overhead, rotating your palms to face forward as you extend your arms.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
