('Skin the Cat', 'back', array['shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'MSfvriJ', array['Begin by hanging from a bar with your arms straight and your body relaxed.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your legs up, bringing your knees toward your chest.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
