('Bench Dip (Weighted)', 'triceps', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'MU9HnE7', array['Take a seat on a bench with your hands gripping the edge, fingers pointing forward.', 'Move your butt off the bench, supporting your weight with your hands.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('Single Arm Push-Up', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'MUic5zN', array['Begin in a push-up position with your hands about shoulder width and one hand placed slightly wider than the other.', 'Brace your trunk and lower your body toward the ground by bending your elbows, with your spine steady.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Single Arm Overhead Carry (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'core']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'mWBtgmb', array['Stand tall and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in one hand.', 'Before moving, raise the dumbbell overhead, fully extending your arm.', 'Stand tall with the load secure and the shoulders level.', 'Walk at a controlled pace, keeping your shoulders level and your steps even.', 'Keep steps even and avoid leaning away from the load.', 'Stop before posture breaks down, set the load down safely, and reset for the next walk.']::text[]),
('Groin Crunch', 'core', array['quads']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'mWppALS', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Set your hands behind your head with your elbows pointing outwards.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Prone Incline Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'mwpPcr1', array['Set the bench to a 45-degree incline.', 'Position yourself face down on the bench with your chest and stomach resting against it.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Inverted Row on Bench', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Mxa7Cr8', array['Prepare a bench at a height that allows your body to hang freely underneath it.', 'Lie face up on the ground with your head toward the bench.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Decline Reverse-Grip Press (Smith Machine)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'MY9P1WA', array['Set the smith machine to a decline position.', 'Get onto the bench with your feet secured under the foot pads.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Seated Reverse Fly (Machine)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'myfUsKf', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handles with palms facing down and keep your arms soft.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'Open your arms out and back with a slight elbow bend, drawing the shoulder blades together.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Lateral Raise (Cable)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'triceps']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'myJeTAe', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, facing the cable machine.', 'Take hold of the cable handle with one hand, palm facing down, and stand far enough away from the machine so that there is tension on the cable.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Raise the arms out to the sides to about shoulder height without leaning or shrugging.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Lying Pronation (Dumbbell)', 'forearms', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'mym4hJo', array['Settle onto a bench with your chest facing down and your arms extended straight down, holding a dumbbell in each hand.', 'Before moving, rotate your palms so they are facing up.', 'Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.', 'Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.', 'Use a small, smooth range without swinging the elbows.', 'Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands.']::text[]),
('Lunge with Biceps Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['quads', 'hamstrings']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'Mz6lLcW', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing forward.', 'Step forward with your right foot, lowering your body into a lunge position. Your right knee should be bent at a 90-degree angle and your left knee should be hovering just above the ground.', 'Set your stance wide enough to balance before bending either knee.', 'Step into the movement and bend both knees, keeping your front foot planted.', 'Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.', 'Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.']::text[]),
('Back Shrug (Smith Machine)', 'traps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'MzNnwx9', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your knees soft.', 'Hold the barbell with palms facing down, hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Let the arms hang long and keep the head neutral.', 'Lift your shoulders toward your ears without bending the elbows or rolling the shoulders.', 'Lift and lower vertically without circling the shoulders.', 'Ease back to the start before repeating.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'n5cWCsI', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in one hand with your palm facing your body.', 'Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position and your core engaged throughout the exercise.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Raise the arms out to the sides to about shoulder height without leaning or shrugging.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('High Row (Kneeling) (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'N6dZN2I', array['Fit a straight bar to the pulley at chest level.', 'Kneel in front of the cable machine and grab the bar with palms facing down, hands about shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Arms Overhead Full Sit-Up', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'NAkmgdx', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Reach your arms overhead, keeping them straight.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Triceps Extension (On Bench) (Dumbbell)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'nAuHPcD', array['Take a seat on a bench with your back straight and feet planted.', 'Take a dumbbell in one hand and place your other hand on the bench for support.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Biceps Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'NbVPDMW', array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward and arms straight.', 'With your upper arms stationary, exhale and curl the weights while contracting your biceps.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Reverse Crunch', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'nCU1Ekp', array['Settle onto your back with your arms extended along your sides.', 'Before moving, bend your knees and lift your feet off the ground, bringing your thighs perpendicular to the floor.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Standing Wide-Grip Curl (Barbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms', 'shoulders']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'NdIb5Z1', array['Stand tall with your feet about shoulder width and hold a barbell with palms facing down, hands wider than about shoulder width.', 'Keep the barbell hanging at arm''s length ahead of your thighs, with your palms turned away from your body.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Lying Bent Arms Pullover (EZ Bar)', 'back', array['triceps', 'chest']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'nDK1HJ0', array['Settle onto a bench with your head at one end and your feet on the floor.', 'Take hold of the EZ barbell with a pronated grip (palms turned away from you) and your hands about shoulder width.', 'Set the ribs down and keep a small elbow bend before lowering the weight.', 'Lower the weight in an arc behind your head until you feel a comfortable shoulder stretch.', 'Keep the ribs down as the arms travel overhead.', 'Pull the weight back over the chest along the same arc, without lifting the ribs.']::text[]),
('Floor Fly (With Barbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'neonEDL', array['Settle onto your back on the floor with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Take a barbell with palms facing down, arms extended straight up over your chest.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Biceps Curl Reverse (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'nFc4FyV', array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing down and arms straight.', 'With your upper arms stationary, exhale and curl the weights while contracting your biceps.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Curl the weight with your palms facing down, keeping the elbows close and torso still.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Lying Alternate Extension (Dumbbell)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'NfP83rA', array['Settle onto a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing each other.', 'Reach your arms straight up over your chest, keeping a slight bend in your elbows.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Rear Delt Row (Smith Machine)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back', 'biceps']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'nFUwqG6', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handles with palms facing down, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Seated Behind Head Military Press (Barbell)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'back']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'ngPpyRS', array['Take a seat on a bench with your back straight and feet planted.', 'Take hold of the barbell with palms facing down, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Seated Chest Press (Cable)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'nIR4Rwl', array['Set the seat height and cable handles to a comfortable position.', 'Take a seat on the bench with your back straight and feet planted.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Biceps Curl Squat (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'niXESDw', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing forward.', 'With your back straight and your elbows close to your sides, exhale and curl the dumbbells up toward your shoulders.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Pelvic Tilt', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'NKJ8o6x', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Set your hands by your sides.', 'Relax the shoulders and find a comfortable neutral starting position.', 'Gently roll the pelvis to flatten and release the lower back through a small range.', 'Use a small range and avoid forcing the lower back into the floor.', 'Release the tilt gently and repeat without forcing the range.']::text[]),
('Decline Single-Arm Fly (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'NL6YBwN', array['Get onto a decline bench with a dumbbell in one hand, resting it on your thigh.', 'Use your thigh to help raise the dumbbell, lift it up to shoulder width with your palm facing your torso.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Alternate Preacher Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'NlfIbzq', array['Take a seat on a preacher bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing up.', 'Set your upper arms on the pad of the preacher bench, letting your arms to fully extend.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl the weight while your upper arms stay in contact with the pad.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Biceps Curl (With Arm Blaster) (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'nlJsbkW', array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward.', 'Hold your elbows near your torso and your upper arms stationary.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Rope High Pulley Overhead Triceps Extension (Cable)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'NN8nSNT', array['Connect a rope to a high pulley and adjust the weight accordingly.', 'Face the away from the pulley machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms pointed upward and extend at the elbows without flaring the ribs.', 'Keep the upper arms steady while the forearms travel.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Kneeling Leg Curl (Machine)', 'hamstrings', array['glutes']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'nnmCTLN', array['Set the machine to fit your body and select the desired weight.', 'Get down on the machine facing downwards, with your knees resting on the pad and your feet secured under the footpads.', 'Line the knees up with the machine or bench edge before starting the curl.', 'Bend your knees to draw the pad toward you without lifting your hips from the support.', 'Keep the hips still while the knees bend.', 'Bring the weight or body back to its starting position without rushing.']::text[]),
('Full Squat (Smith Machine)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'NNoHCEA', array['Prepare the smith machine with the barbell at shoulder height.', 'Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, toes slightly turned out.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Single Leg Squat (Pistol)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'nqs5HGV', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and arms extended in front of you.', 'Before moving, lift your right foot off the ground and extend it forward.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Extend the free leg ahead of you as you squat on the standing leg, keeping its heel grounded.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Seated Straight Back Row (Band)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'Nu7jqFE', array['Take a seat on the floor with your legs extended and loop the resistance band around your feet.', 'Take hold of the ends of the resistance band with your hands, palms facing each other.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Standing Chest Press (Machine)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'numr601', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handles with palms facing down and position your hands at chest level.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Deadlift (Dumbbell)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'nUwVh7b', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, toes pointing forward.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing your body, arms extended downwards.', 'Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.', 'Push the hips back while keeping the load close and the spine steady.', 'Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.', 'Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.']::text[]),
('Incline Raise (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'nxW6BkN', array['Take a seat on an incline bench with a dumbbell in each hand, resting on your thighs.', 'Recline on the bench and raise the dumbbells to shoulder height, palms facing forward.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Lift the weights away from your torso to about shoulder height, keeping the elbows softly bent.', 'Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.']::text[]),
('Reverse Dip', 'triceps', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'NZ5Qqkz', array['Set yourself between two parallel bars with your arms straight and your body straight.', 'Before moving, lower your body by bending your elbows until your upper arms are parallel to the ground.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('High Row (Machine)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'nZZZy9m', array['Set the seat height and foot platform to a comfortable position.', 'Take a seat on the machine with your chest against the pad and your feet flat on the foot platform.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Exercise Ball Back Extension with Hands Behind Head', 'back', array['glutes', 'hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'o1HGDSq', array['Set the stability ball on the ground and Position yourself face down on top of it with your hips resting on the ball.', 'Set your feet against a wall or other stable surface for support.', 'Secure the hips and feet on the support before lifting.', 'Raise your torso or legs until they line up with your body, without arching sharply at the lower back.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Bring the weight or body back to its starting position without rushing.']::text[]),
('Hammer Curl (Barbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'o1ntciW', array['Stand tall with your feet about shoulder width and hold an Olympic barbell with palms facing down.', 'Keep the barbell hanging at arm''s length ahead of your thighs, with your palms facing your body.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Curl with palms facing each other and elbows near your sides; avoid rocking back.', 'Keep the palms facing each other and the wrists straight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Bodyweight Standing Single-Arm Row (With Towel)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'O4oIqQD', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, knees soft, and hold a towel with one hand.', 'Bend forward at the hips, with your spine steady and your core engaged.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Bench Fly (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'o5Jsk92', array['Take a seat on a flat bench with a dumbbell in one hand, resting it on top of your thigh.', 'Recline on the bench, keeping the dumbbell pressed against your thigh.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Reverse Preacher Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'O8Aq69u', array['Take a seat on a preacher bench with your upper arms resting on the pad and your chest against the support.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand with palms facing up.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl the weight while your upper arms stay in contact with the pad.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Press on Exercise Ball (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'O8o7q4d', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with your feet planted and dumbbells in each hand, resting on your thighs.', 'With control walk your feet forward, rolling the exercise ball until your lower back is supported on the ball and your knees are at a 90-degree angle.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Monster Walk', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'weight_reps', 'O95afRA', array['Set a resistance band around your ankles.', 'Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and slightly bend your knees.', 'Stand tall with the load secure and the shoulders level.', 'Walk at a controlled pace, keeping your shoulders level and your steps even.', 'Keep steps even and avoid leaning away from the load.', 'Stop before posture breaks down, set the load down safely, and reset for the next walk.']::text[]),
('Double Windmill (Kettlebell)', 'core', array['shoulders', 'hamstrings']::text[], 'kettlebell', 'weight_reps', 'OaE7CpD', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a kettlebell in your right hand.', 'Reach your right arm overhead, keeping your eyes on the kettlebell.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('Hammer Grip Preacher Curl (Machine)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'OAguZoG', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Set your upper arms on the preacher pad, ensuring your chest is pressed against it.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl the weight while your upper arms stay in contact with the pad.', 'Keep the palms facing each other and the wrists straight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Side Triceps Extension (Band)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'obe5LMq', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold the band with both hands, palms facing down.', 'Reach your arms straight out to the sides, keeping them parallel to the ground.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Standing Single-Arm Palm in Press (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'core']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'ocYc6Db', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in one hand at shoulder height with your palm facing inwards.', 'Brace your trunk and Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Seated Biceps Curl to Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'OeL23VY', array['Take a seat on a bench with your back straight and feet planted.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing forward and arms straight.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Medicine Ball Overhead Slam', 'back', array['shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'other', 'weight_reps', 'oHg8eop', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a medicine ball with both hands above your head.', 'Brace your trunk and Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position.', 'Set a firm stance and leave enough clear space for the ball to travel.', 'Drive the ball away forcefully, using the arms and trunk together; catch or retrieve it before resetting.', 'Follow through with the whole body while keeping control of the landing or catch.', 'Bring the weight or body back to its starting position without rushing.']::text[]),
('Seated Hip Adduction (Machine)', 'quads', array['hamstrings', 'glutes']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'oHsrypV', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Set your feet on the footrests and Hold the handles for stability.', 'Square the pelvis before moving the working leg.', 'Draw the working leg inward against resistance without leaning sideways.', 'Move only as far as the pelvis can remain steady.', 'Ease back to the start before repeating.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Lateral High Row (Machine)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'OIFMAp1', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handle with one hand and Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Lying Back of the Head Triceps Extension (Barbell)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'OJFgZJ0', array['Settle onto a bench with your feet planted and your head at the end of the bench.', 'Take a barbell with palms facing down, hands about shoulder width, and extend your arms straight up over your chest.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep the upper arms steady while the forearms travel.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Run', 'cardio', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'oLrKqDH', array['Begin by standing upright with your feet about hip width.', 'Brace your trunk and keep your upper body relaxed.', 'Start at a pace that lets the feet and arms move in sync.', 'Move at a repeatable pace, keeping the motion smooth and your breathing steady.', 'Keep the pattern repeatable as speed increases.', 'Keep the rhythm for the planned interval, slowing if your form starts to slip.']::text[]),
('Pull Through (With Rope) (Cable)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'back']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'OM46QHm', array['Stand facing away from the low pulley with the rope passing between your legs.', 'Take hold of the rope attachment with both hands and step forward, creating tension in the cable.', 'Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.', 'Push the hips back while keeping the load close and the spine steady.', 'Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.', 'Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.']::text[]),
('Roller Hip Stretch', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads']::text[], 'other', 'duration', 'oMypNrz', array['Begin by sitting on the ground with your legs extended in front of you.', 'Set the roller under your glutes, just above your knees.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Straight-Leg Deadlift (Dumbbell)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'oom75KC', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand with palms facing down.', 'With your back straight and your core engaged, hinge at the hips and lower the dumbbells toward the ground, letting your torso to lean forward.', 'Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.', 'Send your hips back with a soft knee bend, lowering the load close to your legs until the hamstrings stretch.', 'Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.', 'Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.']::text[]),
('Hip Extension (Machine)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'OPqShYN', array['Set the machine to fit your body and sit on it with your back against the backrest.', 'Set your feet on the footrests and grip the handles for stability.', 'Plant the feet and keep the ribs from flaring as the hips prepare to rise.', 'Press through the feet and lift your hips until your torso and thighs line up.', 'Stop when the hips line up with the torso; do not arch higher through the lower back.', 'Lower the hips steadily and keep the feet planted for the next lift.']::text[]),
('Crossover Lateral Pulldown (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'OQ1otBN', array['Connect a cable handle to each side of a cable machine at shoulder height.', 'Take your place in the middle of the machine with your feet about shoulder width.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'Bring the handles across the front of your chest in a broad arc, keeping a slight elbow bend.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Side Push Neck Stretch', 'traps', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'oQRJYkC', array['Either stand or sit up straight with your shoulders relaxed.', 'Tilt your head to the right, bringing your right ear toward your right shoulder.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Reverse Hyper on Flat Bench', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'OrETs32', array['Position yourself face down on a flat bench with your hips at the edge and your legs hanging off the bench.', 'Use the bench for stability.', 'Secure the hips and feet on the support before lifting.', 'Raise your torso or legs until they line up with your body, without arching sharply at the lower back.', 'Finish in a straight body line, before the lower back overarches.', 'Bring the weight or body back to its starting position without rushing.']::text[]),
('Unilateral Row (Machine)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'oROuvrX', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handles with palms facing down and Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Push Press (Kettlebell)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'core']::text[], 'kettlebell', 'weight_reps', 'osdXT3K', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a kettlebell in one hand at shoulder level.', 'Bend your knees slightly and Brace your trunk.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Decline Triceps Extension (Dumbbell)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'OTgkHwR', array['Settle onto a decline bench with your head lower than your feet and hold a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing each other.', 'Reach your arms fully, keeping your elbows close to your head.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep the upper arms steady while the forearms travel.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Lying Biceps Curl (Cable)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'otqIxU4', array['Connect a straight bar to a low pulley cable machine.', 'Lie face up on a flat bench with your feet planted.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Shrug (Smith Machine)', 'traps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'OUQ0ZyW', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your knees soft.', 'Hold the barbell with palms facing down, hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Let the arms hang long and keep the head neutral.', 'Lift your shoulders toward your ears without bending the elbows or rolling the shoulders.', 'Lift and lower vertically without circling the shoulders.', 'Return along the same path at a controlled pace.']::text[]),
('Incline Triceps Extension (Dumbbell)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'OVIKwsd', array['Take a seat on an incline bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing inwards.', 'Reach your arms fully overhead, keeping your elbows close to your head.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep the upper arms steady while the forearms travel.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Incline Palm-In Press (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'OVLmUuL', array['Angle the bench to roughly 45 degrees.', 'Take a seat on the bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing each other.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Ez-Barbell Standing Wide-Grip Biceps Curl', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'OVTZ65k', array['Stand tall with your feet about shoulder width and hold the ez barbell with palms facing up, hands wider than about shoulder width.', 'Hold your elbows near your torso and your upper arms stationary throughout the movement.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Triceps Pushdown (V-Bar) (With Arm Blaster) (Cable)', 'triceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'OxJk1fg', array['Connect a v-bar attachment to the cable machine at the highest setting.', 'Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Stand far enough from the stack for the cable to stay taut.', 'Keep your elbows near your ribs and straighten your arms against the cable.', 'Keep the elbows close to the body instead of letting the shoulders swing.', 'Ease back to the start before repeating.']::text[]),
('Wide-Grip Rear Pull-Up', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'OYFhXVD', array['Take hold of the pull-up bar with a wide overhand grip, hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Suspend yourself from the bar with your arms straight and your body straight.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull up with control, keeping the head neutral and the elbows moving down beside the torso.', 'Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Leg Pull in Flat Bench', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'OyoZ3Pu', array['Take a seat on a flat bench with your legs extended straight out in front of you.', 'Set your hands on the bench beside your hips for support.', 'Brace the abdomen and keep the shoulders anchored to the support.', 'Lift your legs by bracing your trunk and moving at the hips rather than swinging.', 'Slow the legs before they pull the lower back out of position.', 'Lower the legs slowly without swinging or losing your trunk position.']::text[]),
('Tire Flip', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads', 'core']::text[], 'other', 'weight_reps', 'oZjMu1t', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, facing the tire.', 'Before moving, bend your knees and hinge at the hips, lowering into a squat position.', 'Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.', 'Push the hips back while keeping the load close and the spine steady.', 'Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.', 'Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.']::text[]),
('45° Leg Wide Press (Machine)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'p0OCXGb', array['Set the sled machine to a 45-degree angle.', 'Take a seat on the sled machine with your back against the pad and your feet on the foot platform.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Incline Fly on Exercise Ball (Cable)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'P14Dz9D', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with your feet planted and your back against an incline bench.', 'Take a cable handle in one hand with your arm extended and palm facing inward.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Two Toe Touch', 'back', array['hamstrings', 'glutes']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'p195zsJ', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your arms extended out to the sides.', 'Bend forward at the waist, with your spine steady and your knees soft.', 'Soften the knees and let the hips start the fold.', 'Fold forward from the hips and let your hands travel toward your feet without forcing the reach.', 'Keep the movement controlled throughout the range.', 'Hold briefly at a comfortable depth, then rise by extending the hips.']::text[]),
('Preacher Curl (Cable)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'P2lNrGL', array['Set the cable machine so that the preacher curl pad is at chest height.', 'Take a seat on the preacher curl bench and place your upper arms on the pad, gripping the cable attachment with palms facing up.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl the weight while your upper arms stay in contact with the pad.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Standing Zottman Preacher Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'P2nRiUa', array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward.', 'Set your upper arms against the preacher bench and keep your elbows soft.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl palms-up, turn the palms down at the top, and lower with that overhand grip.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Standing Crossover High Reverse Fly (Cable)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'P5p0j8B', array['Connect a D-handle to each side of a cable machine at shoulder height.', 'Take your place in the middle of the cable machine with your feet about shoulder width.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'Bring the handles across the front of your chest in a broad arc, keeping a slight elbow bend.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Iron Cross Stretch', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'p5v6rdT', array['Settle onto your back with your arms extended out to the sides.', 'Raise your legs up toward the ceiling, keeping them straight.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Open the arms out to the sides to form a T, then bring them back under control.', 'Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.']::text[]),
('Push Up on Bosu Ball', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'P7zSvul', array['Set the bosu ball on the ground with the flat side facing up.', 'Set yourself in a push-up position with your hands on the outer edges of the bosu ball.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Spell Caster', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'p9cCe2r', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold a dumbbell in one hand.', 'Bend your knees slightly and hinge forward at the waist, with your spine steady.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('Spider Crawl Push Up', 'glutes', array['core', 'chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'P9GFBME', array['Begin in a push-up position with your hands just beyond shoulder width and your feet together.', 'Bring your right knee toward your right elbow, keeping it off the ground.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Hyght Dumbbell Fly', 'chest', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'P9ZRyLT', array['Settle onto a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing each other.', 'Reach your arms straight up over your chest, with a slight bend in your elbows.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Chest Dip (Kneeling) (Assisted)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'PAgTVaK', array['Set the machine to your desired height and secure your knees on the pad.', 'Hold the handles with your palms facing down and your arms straight.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('Hands Bike', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'pAIWRGu', array['Set the seat height and handlebar position to a comfortable level.', 'Take a seat on the ergometer with your back straight and feet on the pedals.', 'Start at a pace that lets the feet and arms move in sync.', 'Move at a repeatable pace, keeping the motion smooth and your breathing steady.', 'Keep the pattern repeatable as speed increases.', 'Keep the rhythm for the planned interval, slowing if your form starts to slip.']::text[]),
('Incline Y-Raise (Dumbbell)', 'back', array['shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'PbzNu7c', array['Angle an incline bench to a 45-degree angle and sit on it with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing inwards.', 'Tip forward slightly and let your arms hang straight down, keeping a slight bend in your elbows.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Raise the arms diagonally into a Y shape while keeping the shoulders away from your ears.', 'Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.']::text[]),
('Rope Hammer Preacher Curl (Cable)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'PcPe0P5', array['Connect a rope attachment to a low pulley cable machine.', 'Face the machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl the weight while your upper arms stay in contact with the pad.', 'Keep the palms facing each other and the wrists straight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Walk Elliptical Cross Trainer', 'cardio', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'glutes', 'calves']::text[], 'machine', 'duration', 'PCUYOMs', array['Set the resistance level and incline of the elliptical machine to your desired settings.', 'Get onto the pedals of the machine and grip the handles lightly.', 'Stand tall with the load secure and the shoulders level.', 'Walk at a controlled pace, keeping your shoulders level and your steps even.', 'Keep steps even and avoid leaning away from the load.', 'Stop before posture breaks down, set the load down safely, and reset for the next walk.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Incline Chest Press (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'PDaMuyV', array['Set the incline bench to a 45-degree angle.', 'Take a seat on the bench with your back against the pad and feet planted.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Shoulder Press (Band)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'back']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'peAeMR3', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and place the band under your feet.', 'Take hold of the band with your palms facing forward and raise your hands to shoulder height, elbows bent.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Exercise Ball Back Extension with Arms Extended', 'back', array['glutes', 'hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'PERjVm8', array['Set the stability ball on the ground and Position yourself face down on top of it, with your hips resting on the ball and your feet against a wall for stability.', 'Reach your arms straight out in front of you, with your palms facing down.', 'Secure the hips and feet on the support before lifting.', 'Raise your torso or legs until they line up with your body, without arching sharply at the lower back.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Bring the weight or body back to its starting position without rushing.']::text[]),
('Incline Hammer Press (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'PG1kcIb', array['Angle an incline bench to a 45-degree angle and sit on it with a dumbbell in each hand, resting on your thighs.', 'Recline on the bench and position the dumbbells at shoulder level with your palms facing each other.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the palms facing each other and the wrists straight.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Single-Leg Fly on Exercise Ball (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'pH2x2jj', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing each other.', 'Set one foot on the ground and extend the other leg straight out in front of you.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep the pelvis level as the supporting leg does the work.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Hanging Straight-Leg Hip Raise', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'pj0X0tF', array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your arms straight and your palms turned away from you.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your legs up in front of you until they are parallel to the ground.', 'Brace the abdomen and keep the shoulders anchored to the support.', 'Lift your legs by bracing your trunk and moving at the hips rather than swinging.', 'Slow the legs before they pull the lower back out of position.', 'Lower the legs slowly without swinging or losing your trunk position.']::text[]),
('Hip Thrusts on Knees (Band)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'Pjbc0Kt', array['Begin by kneeling on the ground with your knees about hip width and your feet flexed.', 'Loop the resistance band around your thighs, just above your knees.', 'Plant the feet and keep the ribs from flaring as the hips prepare to rise.', 'Press through the feet and lift your hips until your torso and thighs line up.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Lower the hips steadily and keep the feet planted for the next lift.']::text[]),
('Front Lever', 'core', array['back', 'shoulders', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'PkCN2lv', array['Begin by hanging from a pull-up bar with palms facing down, hands about shoulder width.', 'Brace your trunk and pull your shoulder blades down and back.', 'Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.', 'Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.', 'Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.', 'Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.']::text[]),
('Push Sit-Up (Band)', 'core', array['shoulders', 'chest']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'PKlXuJW', array['Connect the band securely to a stable anchor point.', 'Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Jefferson Squat (Barbell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'pkSoCW9', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and toes slightly turned out.', 'Take hold of the barbell with palms facing down, resting it on the front of your body, just below your waist.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Kipping Muscle Up', 'back', array['biceps', 'triceps', 'shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'pM07UxU', array['Begin by hanging from a pull-up bar with palms facing down, hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Brace your trunk and use a swinging motion to generate momentum.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.', 'Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Lunge with Jump', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'PM1PZjg', array['Begin by standing with your feet about shoulder width.', 'Step forward with your right foot, lowering your body into a lunge position.', 'Set your stance wide enough to balance before bending either knee.', 'Step into the movement and bend both knees, keeping your front foot planted.', 'Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.', 'Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.']::text[]),
('Reverse-Grip Straight Back Seated High Row (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'PNtsX17', array['Take a seat on the seat facing the cable machine with your feet planted.', 'Hold the cable attachment with palms facing up, and your hands about shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Wide-Grip Chest Dip (Kneeling) (Assisted)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'PnZJIrk', array['Set the machine to your desired height and secure your knees on the pad.', 'Hold the handles with a wide grip and keep your elbows soft.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('Neutral Grip Bench Press (Dumbbell)', 'triceps', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'pP8wP2P', array['Settle onto a bench with your feet planted and your back pressed against the bench.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand with a neutral grip (palms facing each other) and your arms extended straight up over your chest.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Flag', 'core', array['shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'pQ0Mx1Z', array['Begin by gripping a vertical pole with both hands, palms facing each other, and arms straight.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your legs off the ground, keeping them straight.', 'Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.', 'Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.', 'Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.', 'Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.']::text[]),
('Seated Leg Raise Crunch (Machine)', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'PQ2AtC3', array['Take a seat on the leverage machine with your back against the backrest and your feet on the footrests.', 'Hold the handles or sidebars for stability.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Supine Reverse Fly (Cable)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'PQcUlDi', array['Connect a D-handle to a low pulley cable machine and Position yourself face down on a flat bench.', 'Hold the D-handle with each hand, palms facing down, and extend your arms straight out in front of you.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'Open your arms out and back with a slight elbow bend, drawing the shoulder blades together.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Upper Row (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'PQStVXH', array['Fit a straight bar to the pulley at chest level.', 'Face the machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Standing Fly (Cable)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'Pr9Rhf4', array['Connect the handles to the cables at chest height.', 'Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, turned away from the cable machine.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Rotation Reverse Fly (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'prbWx1D', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing inwards.', 'Bend your knees slightly and hinge forward at the hips, with your spine steady and chest up.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'Open your arms out and back with a slight elbow bend, drawing the shoulder blades together.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Push to Run', 'cardio', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'PrQbjvB', array['Begin in a push-up position with your hands about shoulder width and your body in a straight line.', 'Lower your chest toward the ground by bending your elbows, keeping your body straight.', 'Start at a pace that lets the feet and arms move in sync.', 'Move at a repeatable pace, keeping the motion smooth and your breathing steady.', 'Keep the pattern repeatable as speed increases.', 'Keep the rhythm for the planned interval, slowing if your form starts to slip.']::text[]),
('Pushdown (Straight Arm) (Cable)', 'back', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'PskORrA', array['Connect a straight bar to a high pulley cable machine.', 'Face the machine with your feet about shoulder width and a slight bend in your knees.', 'Stand far enough from the stack for the cable to stay taut.', 'Keep your elbows near your ribs and straighten your arms against the cable.', 'Keep the elbows close to the body instead of letting the shoulders swing.', 'Ease back to the start before repeating.']::text[]),
('Drop Push Up (Weighted)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'PSlvNMs', array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands just beyond shoulder width and your feet together.', 'Lower your chest toward the ground, keeping your elbows close to your body.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Medicine Ball Catch and Overhead Throw', 'back', array['shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'other', 'weight_reps', 'PsVS1QP', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a medicine ball in both hands at chest level.', 'Bend your knees slightly and Brace your trunk.', 'Brace and settle into a stable starting position.', 'Move through the intended path under control, keeping the joints aligned with the resistance.', 'Keep the movement controlled throughout the range.', 'Return along the same path at a controlled pace.']::text[]),
('Push-Up Plus', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'pvBMLHA', array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands just beyond shoulder width and your body in a straight line from head to heels.', 'Lower your body toward the ground by bending your elbows, keeping them close to your sides.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Seated High Row (V-Bar) (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'pwt0pnM', array['Take a seat on the cable machine with your feet planted and your knees soft.', 'Hold the v-bar attachment with palms facing down, palms facing each other, and your hands about shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Medicine Ball Chest Push with Run Release', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'other', 'weight_reps', 'pX9Elbe', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a medicine ball at chest level.', 'Move forward with your right foot and simultaneously push the medicine ball forward, extending your arms fully.', 'Set a firm stance and leave enough clear space for the ball to travel.', 'Drive the ball away forcefully, using the arms and trunk together; catch or retrieve it before resetting.', 'Follow through with the whole body while keeping control of the landing or catch.', 'Bring the weight or body back to its starting position without rushing.']::text[]),
('Arm Slingers Hanging Straight-Legs', 'core', array['shoulders', 'back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'PXTIwgu', array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your arms straight and your legs straight down.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your legs up in front of you until they are parallel to the ground.', 'Brace the abdomen and keep the shoulders anchored to the support.', 'Lift your legs by bracing your trunk and moving at the hips rather than swinging.', 'Slow the legs before they pull the lower back out of position.', 'Lower the legs slowly without swinging or losing your trunk position.']::text[]),
('Lateral Lunge (Barbell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'py1HSzx', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a barbell across your upper back.', 'Step wide to the side with your right foot, keeping your left foot planted.', 'Set your stance wide enough to balance before bending either knee.', 'Step into the movement and bend both knees, keeping your front foot planted.', 'Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.', 'Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.']::text[]),
('Calf Push Stretch with Hands Against Wall', 'calves', array['hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'PzNxakt', array['Face a wall with your feet about hip width.', 'Set your hands against the wall at shoulder height.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Shoulder Press (Cable)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'back']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'PzQanLE', array['Set the cable machine so that the handles are at shoulder height.', 'Face the away from the machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Side Crunch (Cable)', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'q2ADGqV', array['Connect a cable handle to a low pulley and stand sideways to the machine.', 'Hold the handle with the hand furthest from the machine and place your other hand on your hip.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Lying Extension Pullover (With Rope Attachment) (Cable)', 'back', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'Q2Eu1Ax', array['Connect a rope to a cable machine and set the pulley at the highest position.', 'Get onto a bench with your head toward the cable machine.', 'Set the ribs down and keep a small elbow bend before lowering the weight.', 'Lower the weight in an arc behind your head until you feel a comfortable shoulder stretch.', 'Keep the ribs down as the arms travel overhead.', 'Pull the weight back over the chest along the same arc, without lifting the ribs.']::text[]),
('Drop Push Up', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Q497lAE', array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Lower your chest toward the ground, keeping your elbows close to your body.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Row (Smith Machine)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'Q4DSJPC', array['Set the height of the smith machine bar to waist level.', 'Face the smith machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Hanging Straight Twisting Leg Hip Raise', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Q6bvyen', array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your arms straight and your legs straight.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your legs up toward your chest, keeping them straight.', 'Plant the feet and keep the ribs from flaring as the hips prepare to rise.', 'Press through the feet and lift your hips until your torso and thighs line up.', 'Stop when the hips line up with the torso; do not arch higher through the lower back.', 'Lower the hips steadily and keep the feet planted for the next lift.']::text[]),
('Biceps Curl (Machine)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'q6y3OhV', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handles with palms facing up, and Keep your elbows near your ribs.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Alternating Seated Dumbbell Shoulder Press', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'q7qkONO', array['Take a seat on a bench with your back straight and feet planted.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing inwards, and raise them to shoulder height.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Wrist Curl (Dumbbell)', 'forearms', array['biceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'q8aHNoF', array['Take a seat on a bench or chair with your feet planted.', 'Take a dumbbell in one hand with palms facing up, resting your forearm on your thigh.', 'Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.', 'Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('High Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'qAmNMJY', array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward.', 'Let the elbows do the moving while the upper arms stay put and curl the dumbbells as high as possible while contracting your biceps.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Side Bend Crunch (Bosu Ball) (Cable)', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'qatbkEd', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a cable handle in one hand.', 'Set the other hand on your hip.', 'Stand or sit tall with the pelvis facing forward.', 'Bend sideways through the waist without twisting or letting the hips shift.', 'Let the side of the trunk work; do not twist or shift the hips.', 'Return along the same path at a controlled pace.']::text[]),
('Alternate Heel Touchers', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'qaZVsGk', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Reach your arms straight out to the sides, parallel to the ground.', 'Stand or sit tall with the pelvis facing forward.', 'Bend sideways through the waist without twisting or letting the hips shift.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Bring the weight or body back to its starting position without rushing; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Squat to Overhead Reach', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'QChZi3x', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and toes slightly turned out.', 'Before moving, lower your body down into a squat position by bending your knees and pushing your hips back.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Butt-Ups', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'qcNN2FN', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Set your hands by your sides, palms facing down.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('45° Calf Press (Machine)', 'calves', array['hamstrings']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'qCNVnaU', array['Set the sled machine to a 45-degree angle.', 'Set your feet on the sled platform with your toes pointing forward.', 'Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.', 'Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.', 'Pause at the top without rolling the ankles outward.', 'Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.']::text[]),
('Seated Wide-Grip Row (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'qcY50ZD', array['Take a seat on the cable row machine with your feet flat on the footrests and your knees soft.', 'Hold the handle with a wide overhand grip, palms facing down.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Shoulder Tap Push-Up', 'chest', array['triceps', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'qEse6fe', array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands just beyond shoulder width and your body in a straight line from head to heels.', 'Lower your body toward the ground by bending your elbows, keeping them close to your sides.', 'Brace the trunk lightly before moving a limb.', 'Move the working arm or leg while keeping the trunk steady and the breathing even.', 'Keep the pelvis from rocking as the arm or leg moves.', 'Reset your posture before changing sides or beginning the next rep.']::text[]),
('Seated Lower Back Stretch', 'back', array['glutes', 'hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'QFmz6ch', array['Take a seat on the edge of a chair with your feet planted.', 'Set your hands on your thighs or on the sides of the chair for support.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Standing Lift (Cable)', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'qFpAkpP', array['Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Take hold of the cable handle with both hands and position it at waist height.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('Glute Bridge Two-Leg on Bench (Barbell)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'core']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'qg2PGl6', array['Begin by sitting on the edge of a bench with your upper back resting against it and your feet planted, about hip width.', 'Set a barbell across your hips, holding it securely with both hands.', 'Plant the feet and keep the ribs from flaring as the hips prepare to rise.', 'Press through the feet and lift your hips until your torso and thighs line up.', 'Stop when the hips line up with the torso; do not arch higher through the lower back.', 'Lower the hips steadily and keep the feet planted for the next lift.']::text[]),
('Clean-Grip Front Squat (Barbell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves', 'core']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'qi996YS', array['Begin by standing with your feet about shoulder width and the barbell resting on your upper chest, with your elbows pointing forward.', 'Before moving, lower your body by bending your knees and pushing your hips back, as if you are sitting back into a chair.', 'Brace before the pull and keep the load close to the body.', 'Drive through the legs and hips, then guide the weight to its receiving position.', 'Receive the load with the torso braced and feet stable.', 'Stand tall to finish, then lower the weight under control before the next rep.']::text[]),
('Step-Up Split Squat (Dumbbell)', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'QjE2DcA', array['Take your place in front of a bench or step with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing your body.', 'Set your right foot on the bench or step, ensuring your entire foot is in contact with the surface.', 'Put the lead foot fully on the platform before shifting your weight onto it.', 'Step onto the platform and drive through the lead foot to stand tall on it.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Decline Sit-Up', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'QLL2gdc', array['Settle onto a decline bench with your feet secured and your knees bent.', 'Set your hands behind your head or across your chest.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Back Extension on Exercise Ball', 'back', array['glutes', 'hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'qLpO4vV', array['Set the stability ball on the ground and Position yourself face down on top of it, with your hips resting on the ball and your feet against a wall or other stable surface.', 'Set your hands behind your head or crossed over your chest.', 'Secure the hips and feet on the support before lifting.', 'Raise your torso or legs until they line up with your body, without arching sharply at the lower back.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Return along the same path at a controlled pace.']::text[]),
('Seated Alternate Hammer Curl on Exercise Ball (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'QLRmNeT', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with your feet planted and your back straight.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing your body and your arms straight.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Curl with palms facing each other and elbows near your sides; avoid rocking back.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Lying Wide Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'qm9veZw', array['Settle onto a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing up and arms straight.', 'With your upper arms stationary, exhale and curl the weights while contracting your biceps.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Hanging Leg-Hip Raise (Weighted)', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'QOA0FD0', array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your arms straight and your palms turned away from you.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your legs up in front of you, keeping them straight.', 'Plant the feet and keep the ribs from flaring as the hips prepare to rise.', 'Press through the feet and lift your hips until your torso and thighs line up.', 'Stop when the hips line up with the torso; do not arch higher through the lower back.', 'Lower the hips steadily and keep the feet planted for the next lift.']::text[]),
('Preacher Curl (Barbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'qOgPVf6', array['Take a seat on a preacher bench with your upper arms resting on the pad and your chest against the support.', 'Hold the barbell with palms facing up, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl the weight while your upper arms stay in contact with the pad.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Behind Head Chest Stretch', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'QoHIhPl', array['Stand tall and set your feet about shoulder width.', 'Lace your fingers behind your head with your elbows pointing outwards.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Standing Calves Calf Stretch', 'calves', array['hamstrings', 'glutes']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'qOKcgVP', array['Face a wall or sturdy object, about an arm''s length away.', 'Set your hands on the wall or object at shoulder height.', 'Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.', 'Ease the heel down and shift until the calf stretches; keep the foot pointed ahead.', 'Pause at the top without rolling the ankles outward.', 'Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.']::text[]),
('Wind Sprints', 'core', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Qoujh3Q', array['Choose an open space or a track to perform the exercise.', 'Begin by standing with your feet about shoulder width.', 'Start at a pace that lets the feet and arms move in sync.', 'Move at a repeatable pace, keeping the motion smooth and your breathing steady.', 'Keep the pattern repeatable as speed increases.', 'Keep the rhythm for the planned interval, slowing if your form starts to slip.']::text[]),
('Farmers Walk', 'quads', array['calves', 'forearms', 'core']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'qPEzJjA', array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing your sides.', 'Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position and your shoulders back.', 'Stand tall with the load secure and the shoulders level.', 'Walk at a controlled pace, keeping your shoulders level and your steps even.', 'Keep steps even and avoid leaning away from the load.', 'Stop before posture breaks down, set the load down safely, and reset for the next walk.']::text[]),
('Suspended Split Squat', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'QpXqiq8', array['Face the away from a suspension trainer from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Reach one leg forward and place the top of your foot in the foot cradle of the suspension trainer.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Wide-Grip Pull-Up', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Qqi7bko', array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your palms turned away from you and your hands wider than about shoulder width.', 'Brace your trunk and draw your shoulder blades toward each other.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.', 'Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Triceps Pushdown (Cable)', 'triceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'qRZ5S1N', array['Face a cable machine with a straight bar attachment at chest height.', 'Hold the bar with palms facing down and step back to create tension in the cable.', 'Stand far enough from the stack for the cable to stay taut.', 'Keep your elbows near your ribs and straighten your arms against the cable.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Return along the same path at a controlled pace; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Single Leg Reverse Calf Raise (Band)', 'calves', array['hamstrings', 'glutes']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'QsSQWbf', array['Stand and set your feet about hip width and place the band around the ball of your foot.', 'Use a stable object for balance.', 'Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.', 'Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.']::text[]),
('Seated Alternate Press (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'chest']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'QT5Q0nK', array['Take a seat on a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward.', 'Before moving, raise the dumbbells to shoulder height, with your elbows bent and palms facing forward.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Pulldown Biceps Curl (Cable)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'QTXKWPh', array['Connect a straight bar to the cable machine at the highest setting.', 'Face the machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Sit tall and set the shoulders before drawing the handle down.', 'Pull the handle down by driving your elbows toward your ribs; keep your torso steady.', 'Pull with the elbows rather than leaning far back to move the handle.', 'Let the handle rise steadily until the arms are long, then reset the shoulders.']::text[]),
('Standing Single-Arm Triceps Extension (Cable)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'qU8bYp7', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, facing the cable machine.', 'Take hold of the cable handle with your right hand, palm facing down, and position your arm so that it is straight and parallel to the ground.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Oblique Crunches Floor', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'QUDd8WS', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Set your hands behind your head or cross them over your chest.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Seated Piriformis Stretch', 'glutes', array['hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'QY39eBr', array['Take a seat on the ground with your legs extended in front of you.', 'Before moving, bend your right knee and place your right foot on the outside of your left knee.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Landmine 180', 'core', array['quads']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'QYysSLV', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold the barbell with both hands ahead of your chest.', 'Bend your knees slightly and rotate your torso to the right, swinging the barbell down toward your right hip.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Press on Exercise Ball (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps', 'core']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'QZFv5ui', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with your feet planted and your knees bent at a 90-degree angle.', 'Take a dumbbell in one hand and position it at shoulder height, with your elbow bent and palm facing forward.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Pendlay Row (Barbell)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'r0z6xzQ', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your knees soft.', 'Bend forward at the hips, with your spine steady and your chest up.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Suspended Reverse Crunch', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'R1WYG5D', array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your arms straight and your palms turned away from you.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your knees up toward your chest, curling your pelvis toward your ribcage.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Assisted Pull-Up (Band)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'r1XNRYB', array['Connect the band to a pull-up bar or sturdy anchor point.', 'Step onto the band and grip the bar with your palms turned away from you, hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Seated Calf Raise (Dumbbell)', 'calves', array['hamstrings']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'r29jP7S', array['Take a seat on a bench or chair with your feet planted and a dumbbell resting on your thighs.', 'Set the balls of your feet on a raised surface such as a step or block, with your heels hanging off the edge.', 'Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.', 'Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.', 'Pause at the top without rolling the ankles outward.', 'Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.']::text[]),
('Supported Squat (Dumbbell)', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'r5DgrW9', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand at your sides.', 'With your chest up and core engaged, With control lower your body down by bending your knees and pushing your hips back.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Cambered Bar Lying Row', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'R5swFnc', array['Prepare a barbell on the floor and Position yourself face down on a bench with your chest just off the edge.', 'Reach down and grab the barbell with palms facing down, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Motion Russian Twist (Assisted)', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'other', 'weight_reps', 'r7cT9YD', array['Take a seat on the ground with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Take hold of the medicine ball with both hands ahead of your chest.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('Cross Body Crunch', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'rbu5UUb', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Set your hands behind your head with your elbows pointing outwards.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Incline Single-Arm Press (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'rDAiRf9', array['Take a seat on an incline bench with a dumbbell in one hand, resting on your thigh.', 'Recline on the bench and position the dumbbell at shoulder level, palm facing forward.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Decline Twist Fly (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'reFHapa', array['Get onto a decline bench with your head lower than your hips.', 'Take a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing each other and your arms extended straight up over your chest.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.', 'Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Decline Chest Press (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'REGM1dE', array['Settle onto a decline bench with a dumbbell in one hand, resting on your chest.', 'Set your feet planted and keep your back pressed against the bench.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Lying Supination on Floor (Dumbbell)', 'forearms', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'rEhi2o5', array['Settle onto your back on the floor with your legs extended and your arms by your sides, holding a dumbbell in each hand.', 'Before moving, rotate your palms to face up, keeping your elbows close to your sides.', 'Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.', 'Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.', 'Use a small, smooth range without swinging the elbows.', 'Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands.']::text[]),
('Sledge Hammer', 'core', array['forearms', 'shoulders']::text[], 'other', 'weight_reps', 'REXmfVC', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold the sledge hammer with both hands.', 'Brace your trunk and Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position.', 'Start at a pace that lets the feet and arms move in sync.', 'Swing the hammer down with a coordinated hip turn, then reset your grip and stance.', 'Keep the palms facing each other and the wrists straight.', 'Keep the rhythm for the planned interval, slowing if your form starts to slip.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Floor Press (Kettlebell)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'kettlebell', 'weight_reps', 'rg59QCH', array['Settle onto your back on the floor with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Take hold of the kettlebell in one hand with your palm facing toward your feet and your arm extended straight up toward the ceiling.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Wide-Grip Upright Row (Barbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'biceps']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'RgJDRR1', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold a barbell with palms facing down, hands wider than about shoulder width.', 'Keep the barbell hanging ahead of your thighs, arms straight.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Low Bar Squat (Smith Machine)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'RGLscZM', array['Prepare the smith machine with the barbell at a height that allows you to comfortably rest it on your upper back.', 'Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, toes slightly turned outwards.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Standing Leg Calf Raise (Barbell)', 'calves', array['hamstrings', 'glutes']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'rGwhJ5o', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and place a barbell across your upper back.', 'Before moving, raise your heels off the ground as high as possible, using your calves.', 'Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.', 'Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.', 'Pause at the top without rolling the ankles outward.', 'Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.']::text[]),
('Mountain Climber', 'cardio', array['core', 'shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'RJgzwny', array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands directly under your shoulders and your body in a straight line.', 'Brace your trunk and bring your right knee toward your chest, then quickly switch and bring your left knee toward your chest.', 'Brace the trunk lightly before moving a limb.', 'Move the working arm or leg while keeping the trunk steady and the breathing even.', 'Keep the pelvis from rocking as the arm or leg moves.', 'Reset your posture before changing sides or beginning the next rep.']::text[]),
('Twin Handle Parallel Grip Lat Pulldown', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'rkg41Fb', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handles with palms facing down, hands about shoulder width.', 'Sit tall and set the shoulders before drawing the handle down.', 'Pull the handle down by driving your elbows toward your ribs; keep your torso steady.', 'Pull with the elbows rather than leaning far back to move the handle.', 'Let the handle rise steadily until the arms are long, then reset the shoulders.']::text[]),
('Side Bridge', 'core', array['glutes']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'RKjH6Lt', array['Settle onto your side with your legs extended and stacked on top of each other.', 'Set your forearm on the ground directly below your shoulder, with your elbow bent at a 90-degree angle.', 'Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.', 'Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.', 'Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.', 'Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.']::text[]),
('Single Leg Bridge with Outstretched Leg', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'rmEukuS', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Reach one leg straight out in front of you.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Frog Planche', 'core', array['shoulders', 'chest', 'triceps']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'rQhGcin', array['Set a straight-arm plank with the hands below the shoulders and the feet together.', 'Bend your elbows and lower your body toward the ground, with your spine steady.', 'Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.', 'Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.', 'Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.', 'Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.']::text[]),
('Lying Gluteus and Piriformis Stretch (Assisted)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'RQNVT10', array['Settle onto your back with your legs extended.', 'Before moving, bend your right knee and place your right ankle on your left thigh, just above the knee.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Reverse Crunch (Cable)', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'RqOtqD7', array['Connect a cable to a low pulley and lie down facing up on a mat.', 'Take hold of the cable with both hands and extend your arms straight up toward the ceiling.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Handstand Push-Up', 'triceps', array['shoulders', 'chest', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'rQxwMxO', array['Choose a wall and face away from it, standing a few feet away.', 'Set your hands on the ground about shoulder width and kick your feet up against the wall, coming into a handstand position.', 'Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.', 'Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.', 'Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.', 'Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.']::text[]),
('Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'back']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'rR0LJzx', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand with palms facing down.', 'With your back straight and your core engaged, hinge at the hips and lower the dumbbells toward the ground, letting your knees to bend slightly.', 'Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.', 'Send your hips back with a soft knee bend, lowering the load close to your legs until the hamstrings stretch.', 'Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.', 'Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.']::text[]),
('Bench Dip (Knees Bent)', 'triceps', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'RrLske5', array['Take a seat on the edge of a bench or chair with your hands gripping the edge next to your hips.', 'Move your butt off the bench and straighten your legs in front of you, keeping your heels on the ground.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('Standing Around World (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'RSOsp5d', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold a dumbbell in each hand.', 'Reach your arms straight out to the sides at shoulder height, palms facing down.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Guide the weights through a broad circular arc without leaning or swinging.', 'Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Against Wall', 'back', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Rsxr3xl', array['Face the wall from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Reach one arm straight out in front of you and place your palm against the wall.', 'Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.', 'Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Exercise Ball Lying Side Lat Stretch', 'back', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'rTbyBYV', array['Settle onto your side with your legs extended and your head supported by the stability ball.', 'Set your top arm on the ball for stability.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Arms Apart Circular Toe Touch', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'RtyAsy1', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and arms extended to the sides.', 'With your legs straight, bend forward at the waist and reach down toward your toes with your right hand.', 'Soften the knees and let the hips start the fold.', 'Fold forward from the hips and let your hands travel toward your feet without forcing the reach.', 'Keep the movement controlled throughout the range.', 'Hold briefly at a comfortable depth, then rise by extending the hips.']::text[]),
('Back Extension (Machine)', 'back', array['glutes', 'hamstrings']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'rUXfn3R', array['Set the machine to fit your body size and range of motion.', 'Take a seat on the machine with your back against the pad and your feet secured.', 'Secure the hips and feet on the support before lifting.', 'Raise your torso or legs until they line up with your body, without arching sharply at the lower back.', 'Finish in a straight body line, before the lower back overarches.', 'Ease back to the start before repeating.']::text[]),
('Pulldown (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'RVwzP10', array['Set the cable pulldown machine so that the seat is at a comfortable height and the knee pad is secured.', 'Take a seat on the seat with your back straight and your feet planted.', 'Sit tall and set the shoulders before drawing the handle down.', 'Pull the handle down by driving your elbows toward your ribs; keep your torso steady.', 'Pull with the elbows rather than leaning far back to move the handle.', 'Let the handle rise steadily until the arms are long, then reset the shoulders.']::text[]),
('Korean Dips', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'rWoBmi5', array['Set yourself between two parallel bars with your arms extended and supporting your body weight.', 'Before moving, lower your body by bending your elbows until your upper arms are parallel to the ground.', 'Set the shoulders down and keep the elbows pointed mostly behind you.', 'Bend the elbows to lower between the supports; stop at a comfortable shoulder depth.', 'Choose a depth that lets the shoulders stay comfortable.', 'Press through the hands to rise, then reset the shoulders before another rep.']::text[]),
('Squat Jump Step Rear Lunge (Barbell)', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'RYcV1kH', array['Begin by standing with your feet about shoulder width, holding a barbell across your upper back.', 'Before moving, lower your body into a squat position by bending your knees and pushing your hips back.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Seated Single-Arm Concentration Curl (Cable)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'rZ80Gbp', array['Plant both feet while seated on a bench; your back straight.', 'Take a cable handle with one hand and place your elbow on the inside of your thigh, just above the knee.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Bodyweight Kneeling Triceps Extension', 'triceps', array['shoulders', 'chest']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 's0HKO2I', array['Get down on the ground with your knees about hip width.', 'Set your hands on the ground in front of you, about shoulder width, fingers pointing forward.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep the upper arms steady while the forearms travel.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Seated Twist (On Stability Ball) (Weighted)', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'weight_reps', 's34Y4LR', array['Take a seat on a stability ball with your feet planted and your knees bent at a 90-degree angle.', 'Take a weight plate or dumbbell with both hands close to your chest.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Jerk (Kettlebell)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'core']::text[], 'kettlebell', 'weight_reps', 'S37C94C', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a kettlebell in one hand at shoulder height.', 'Bend your knees slightly and Brace your trunk.', 'Brace before the pull and keep the load close to the body.', 'Drive through the legs and hips, then guide the weight to its receiving position.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Stand tall to finish, then lower the weight under control before the next rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
