('Single-Arm Seated Biceps Curl on Exercise Ball (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 's999Hdo', array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with your feet planted and your back straight.', 'Take a dumbbell in one hand with your palm facing up and your arm straight.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Rear Delt Row (Barbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back', 'biceps']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'S9zHIvU', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and knees soft.', 'Take a barbell with palms facing down, hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Backward Jump', 'quads', array['hamstrings', 'glutes', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'SaDOwk7', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width.', 'Before moving, bend your knees slightly and jump backwards, pushing off with both feet.', 'Bend the hips and knees slightly to load the jump.', 'Load the legs with a small bend, then drive through the floor and land softly.', 'Land with bent hips and knees and let the feet absorb the impact.', 'Absorb the landing through the hips and knees before repeating.']::text[]),
('Triceps Extension (Machine)', 'triceps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'Ser9eQp', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handles with palms facing down and straighten your arms in front of you.', 'Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.', 'Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.', 'Keep the upper arms steady while the forearms travel.', 'Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.']::text[]),
('Clean and Press (Barbell)', 'quads', array['hamstrings', 'glutes', 'shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'SGY8Zui', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and the barbell on the floor in front of you.', 'Bend your knees and hinge at the hips to lower down and grip the barbell with palms facing down, hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Brace before the pull and keep the load close to the body.', 'Drive through the legs and hips, then guide the weight to its receiving position.', 'Receive the load with the torso braced and feet stable.', 'Stand tall to finish, then lower the weight under control before the next rep.']::text[]),
('Decline Single-Arm Hammer Press (Dumbbell)', 'triceps', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'SHUMp5H', array['Settle onto a decline bench with a dumbbell in one hand, resting on your chest.', 'Extend your arm straight up, keeping your elbow soft.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Power Clean', 'hamstrings', array['glutes', 'quads', 'calves']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'SiWCcTN', array['Start with the barbell on the ground in front of you, with your feet about shoulder width.', 'Bend down and grip the barbell with palms facing down, just beyond shoulder width.', 'Brace before the pull and keep the load close to the body.', 'Drive through the legs and hips, then guide the weight to its receiving position.', 'Receive the load with the torso braced and feet stable.', 'Stand tall to finish, then lower the weight under control before the next rep.']::text[]),
('Palms Up Wrist Curl Over a Bench (Barbell)', 'forearms', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'SJAA2IQ', array['Plant both feet while seated on a bench; hold a barbell with palms facing up.', 'Support the forearms on the bench while leaving the wrists free beyond its edge.', 'Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.', 'Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.', 'Use a small, smooth range without swinging the elbows.', 'Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands.']::text[]),
('Biceps Leg Concentration Curl', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'sJFIDIp', array['Take a seat on a bench with your legs spread apart and your feet planted.', 'Take a dumbbell in one hand and place your elbow on the inside of your thigh, just above the knee.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Rope Seated Row (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'SJqRxOt', array['Take a seat on the rowing machine with your feet flat on the footrests and knees soft.', 'Hold the cable ropes with palms facing down, palms facing each other.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Roller Reverse Crunch', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'other', 'bodyweight_reps', 'SKXQAx3', array['Settle onto your back with your arms extended straight above your head and your legs straight out in front of you.', 'Set the roller between your feet and grip it with your toes.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Exercise Ball Lat Stretch', 'back', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'sM84pE4', array['Take a seat on a stability ball with your feet planted and your back straight.', 'Take a dumbbell in one hand and extend your arm straight up overhead.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Crunch (On Stability Ball, Arms Straight)', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Sn8wxAI', array['Take a seat on the stability ball with your feet planted and your knees bent at a 90-degree angle.', 'Recline on the ball until your lower back is supported and your upper body is parallel to the floor.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Lying Lifting (On Hip) (Barbell)', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'SNFfUff', array['Settle onto your back on a bench with your feet planted and your knees bent.', 'Take hold of the barbell with palms facing down and position it on your hips.', 'Plant the feet and keep the ribs from flaring as the hips prepare to rise.', 'Press through the feet and lift your hips until your torso and thighs line up.', 'Stop when the hips line up with the torso; do not arch higher through the lower back.', 'Lower the hips steadily and keep the feet planted for the next lift.']::text[]),
('Plyo Push Up', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'Snj1wSv', array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Lower your chest toward the ground by bending your elbows, keeping your body in a straight line.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Diamond Push-Up', 'triceps', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'soIB2rj', array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands close together, forming a diamond shape with your thumbs and index fingers.', 'Hold your body in a straight line from head to toe, engaging your core and glutes.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Swimmer Kicks', 'glutes', array['hamstrings', 'quads', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'SP3hUez', array['Position yourself face down on a mat with your arms extended overhead.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your chest and legs off the ground simultaneously.', 'Brace the trunk lightly before moving a limb.', 'Move the working arm or leg while keeping the trunk steady and the breathing even.', 'Keep the pelvis from rocking as the arm or leg moves.', 'Reset your posture before changing sides or beginning the next rep.']::text[]),
('Rear Pulldown (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'SpsOSXk', array['Set the cable machine so that the pulley is at the highest position.', 'Sit facing the machine with your feet planted and your knees soft.', 'Sit tall and set the shoulders before drawing the handle down.', 'Pull the handle down by driving your elbows toward your ribs; keep your torso steady.', 'Pull with the elbows rather than leaning far back to move the handle.', 'Let the handle rise steadily until the arms are long, then reset the shoulders.']::text[]),
('Rear Lunge (Dumbbell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'SSsBDwB', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand.', 'Step backward with your right foot, lowering your body into a lunge position.', 'Set your stance wide enough to balance before bending either knee.', 'Step into the movement and bend both knees, keeping your front foot planted.', 'Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.', 'Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.']::text[]),
('Reverse Fly (Band)', 'shoulders', array['back', 'traps']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'sTfvVsG', array['Connect the band to a stationary object at chest height.', 'Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold the band with both hands in front of you.', 'Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.', 'Open your arms out and back with a slight elbow bend, drawing the shoulder blades together.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.']::text[]),
('Front Lateral Raise (Band)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'sTg7iys', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold the band ahead of your thighs with your palms facing down.', 'Maintain straight arms and lift the band up in front of you until your arms are parallel to the ground.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Raise the arms out to the sides to about shoulder height without leaning or shrugging.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.']::text[]),
('Leg Up Hamstring Stretch', 'hamstrings', array['glutes']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'sU5BrfP', array['Settle onto your back with your legs extended.', 'Bend one knee and bring it toward your chest, holding onto your thigh or shin.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('March Sit (Wall)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'sVQCCeG', array['Stand and set your back against a wall and your feet about hip width.', 'With control slide your back down the wall until your knees are bent at a 90-degree angle.', 'Brace the trunk lightly before moving a limb.', 'Lift one knee at a time while holding the wall-sit depth and keeping your back against the wall.', 'Keep the pelvis from rocking as the arm or leg moves.', 'Reset your posture before changing sides or beginning the next rep.']::text[]),
('Exercise Ball Pike Push Up', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'sVvXT5J', array['Begin in a push-up position with your hands on the floor and your shins resting on the stability ball.', 'Brace your trunk and lift your hips up toward the ceiling, rolling the ball toward your hands.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Standing Alternate Raise (Dumbbell)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'SxHteRW', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing your body.', 'Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position and your core engaged.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Lift the weights away from your torso to about shoulder height, keeping the elbows softly bent.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Zottman Preacher Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'sxY5Biu', array['Take a seat on a preacher curl bench and hold a dumbbell in one hand with palms facing up.', 'Set your upper arm on the preacher bench pad, letting your arm to fully extend.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl palms-up, turn the palms down at the top, and lower with that overhand grip.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Lying Preacher Curl (Barbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'SYJ4Bkt', array['Take a seat on a preacher bench with your chest against the pad and your arms extended over the edge, holding a barbell with palms facing up.', 'With your upper arms stationary, exhale and curl the weights while contracting your biceps.', 'Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.', 'Curl the weight while your upper arms stay in contact with the pad.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Negative Crunch', 'core', '{}'::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'szIn2UK', array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.', 'Set your hands behind your head with your elbows pointing outwards.', 'Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.', 'Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.', 'Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.', 'Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.']::text[]),
('Kneeling Twist (Machine)', 'core', array['back']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'sZOR9EV', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handles or the sides of the machine for stability.', 'Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.', 'Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.', 'Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.', 'Return through center before turning to the other side.']::text[]),
('Reverse-Grip Bent Over Row (Barbell)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'SzX3uzM', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and knees soft.', 'Take a barbell with palms facing down, and hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Squat on Bosu Ball', 'quads', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'T2fA5Ir', array['Set the bosu ball on the ground with the flat side up.', 'Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and position yourself on top of the bosu ball.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Lunge (Barbell)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 't8iSghb', array['Begin by standing with your feet about shoulder width and a barbell resting on your upper back.', 'Step forward with your right foot, keeping your torso upright.', 'Set your stance wide enough to balance before bending either knee.', 'Step into the movement and bend both knees, keeping your front foot planted.', 'Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.', 'Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.']::text[]),
('Mixed Grip Chin-Up', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'T8UpLkb', array['Take hold of the pull-up bar with palms facing up (palms facing toward you) and your hands just beyond shoulder width.', 'Suspend yourself from the bar with your arms straight and your feet off the ground.', 'Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.', 'Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.', 'Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.', 'Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.']::text[]),
('Standing Rear Delt Row (Band)', 'shoulders', array['traps', 'back', 'biceps']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'tc5dYrf', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and place the band under your feet.', 'Take hold of the band handles with your palms facing each other and your arms extended in front of you.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Front Raise (Band)', 'shoulders', array['triceps', 'back']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'TFA88iB', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold the band ahead of your thighs with your palms facing down.', 'Maintain straight arms and With control raise them forward until they are parallel to the ground.', 'Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.', 'Lift the arms forward to about shoulder height, keeping the ribs down and torso still.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.']::text[]),
('Intermediate Hip Flexor and Quad Stretch', 'quads', array['hamstrings', 'glutes']::text[], 'cable', 'duration', 'tFGKm99', array['Stand upright with your feet about shoulder width.', 'Use a stable object for support.', 'Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.', 'Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.', 'Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.', 'Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.']::text[]),
('Reverse Plank with Leg Lift', 'core', array['glutes', 'hamstrings', 'shoulders']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'tFToB7l', array['Take a seat on the ground with your legs extended in front of you and your hands resting on the ground behind you, fingers pointing toward your feet.', 'Before moving, press through your hands and lift your hips off the ground, coming into a reverse plank position.', 'Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.', 'Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.', 'Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.', 'Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.']::text[]),
('Push-Up (On Stability Ball)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'tgryw5Y', array['Set the stability ball on the ground and position yourself facing down with your hands on the ball, about shoulder width.', 'Reach your legs straight out behind you, balancing on your toes.', 'Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.', 'Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.', 'Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.', 'Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.']::text[]),
('Reverse-Grip Triceps Pushdown (Sz-Bar) (With Arm Blaster) (Cable)', 'triceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'ThKP69G', array['Connect a straight bar to the cable machine at the highest setting.', 'Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.', 'Stand far enough from the stack for the cable to stay taut.', 'Keep your elbows near your ribs and straighten your arms against the cable.', 'Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.', 'Ease back to the start before repeating.']::text[]),
('Seated Curl (Dumbbell)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'TiaZTxx', array['Plant both feet while seated on a bench; a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward.', 'Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position and your elbows close to your torso.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Bodyweight Standing Close-Grip Row', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'tig3PXb', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and knees soft.', 'Bend forward at the waist, with your spine steady and your core engaged.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Biceps Curl (With Arm Blaster) (EZ Bar)', 'biceps', array['forearms']::text[], 'barbell', 'weight_reps', 'tJ5nYqo', array['Stand tall with your feet about shoulder width and hold the ez barbell with palms facing up.', 'Set your upper arms against the arm blaster, keeping them stationary throughout the exercise.', 'Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.', 'Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.', 'Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.', 'Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.']::text[]),
('Swing 360', 'cardio', array['shoulders', 'core']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'duration', 'tnaj0mT', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and knees soft.', 'Keep your arms straight out in front of you, parallel to the ground.', 'Set the shoulders and let the weight move back between the legs as the hips hinge.', 'Hinge back, then drive the hips forward to send the weight up; let the arms guide it.', 'Let the hips, not the shoulders, provide the power.', 'Let the weight fall naturally and hinge again for the next swing.']::text[]),
('Straight Back Seated Row (Cable)', 'back', array['biceps', 'forearms', 'shoulders']::text[], 'cable', 'weight_reps', 'Tq6gbK6', array['Take a seat on the cable row machine with your feet flat on the footrests and your knees soft.', 'Hold the cable handles with palms facing down.', 'Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.', 'Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.', 'Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.', 'Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.']::text[]),
('Shrug (Band)', 'traps', array['shoulders']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'trmte8s', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and place the band under your feet, holding the ends with your hands.', 'Maintain straight arms and relaxed, and let the band hang ahead of your thighs.', 'Let the arms hang long and keep the head neutral.', 'Lift your shoulders toward your ears without bending the elbows or rolling the shoulders.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Return along the same path at a controlled pace.']::text[]),
('Bench Press (Smith Machine)', 'chest', array['triceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'trqKQv2', array['Set the height of the smith machine bar to chest level.', 'Settle onto the bench with your feet firmly planted on the ground.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.']::text[]),
('Single-Arm Lateral Wide Pulldown (Machine)', 'back', array['biceps', 'shoulders']::text[], 'machine', 'weight_reps', 'tTuZSDT', array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.', 'Hold the handle with palms facing down and fully extend your arm, keeping a slight bend in your elbow.', 'Sit tall and set the shoulders before drawing the handle down.', 'Pull the handle down by driving your elbows toward your ribs; keep your torso steady.', 'Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.', 'Let the handle rise steadily until the arms are long, then reset the shoulders; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
('Squat (Band)', 'glutes', array['quads', 'hamstrings', 'calves']::text[], 'band', 'weight_reps', 'TUZLh71', array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, with the band placed just above your knees.', 'With your chest up and core engaged, push your hips back and bend your knees to lower into a squat position.', 'Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.', 'Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.', 'Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.', 'Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.']::text[]),
('Inchworm', 'core', array['shoulders', 'hamstrings']::text[], 'bodyweight', 'bodyweight_reps', 'TV87DNB', array['Begin in a standing position with your feet about hip width.', 'Before moving, bend forward at the waist and place your hands on the ground in front of you.', 'Tighten the abdomen and keep the pelvis tucked before the arms reach away.', 'Reach the arms away while keeping your ribs and pelvis aligned; stop before the lower back sags.', 'Stop reaching when the lower back starts to sag.', 'Pull back to the start through your shoulders and abdominals, keeping the same body line.']::text[]),
('Incline Alternate Press (Dumbbell)', 'chest', array['shoulders', 'triceps']::text[], 'dumbbell', 'weight_reps', 'TVdivgY', array['Take a seat on an incline bench with a dumbbell in each hand, resting on your thighs.', 'Recline on the bench and use your thighs to help raise the dumbbells to shoulder height, palms facing forward.', 'Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.', 'Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.', 'Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.', 'Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.']::text[]),
